; OVL_CODE0.A99 -- target-code bank 0 marker
;
; Gives link99 -Y the bank's segment (>C000) for its OVL_TABLE row.  It
; holds NO bytes: the shell loader refuses EXE data at >C000 and above,
; and the bank is only ever written by LINK99 at run time.

        AORG    0C000H
C0:
        ENT     C0
        END
